    "factsheet": [
        {
            "heading": "Ibraaz - a space for art, culture, and ideas",
            "paragraphs": [
                "Ibraaz is a London cultural institution for art, ideas, and dialogue from the Global Majority. Bringing together artists, thinkers, and communities through exhibitions, film, debate, publishing, and multidisciplinary programming, Ibraaz creates a brave space where culture fosters exchange, pluralism, and shared humanity.",
                "Join us for a tour of our café, bookshop and Rakyat Pasti Menang, the first London exhibition by Indonesian collective Taring Padi. Forged in the 1998 Reformasi movement, the exhibition traces nearly three decades of art created for the streets, protests and grassroots political organising."
            ]
        }
